# Vendored build output: byte-for-byte what Vite produced, never normalised.
#
# With core.autocrlf on, git rewrites these on checkout, so the working tree
# stops matching what the build wrote and `git status` reports the vendored
# dashboard as modified after every single build. That makes "is the bundle in
# this checkout current?" unanswerable from git status - and answering it wrong
# is how a months-old dashboard ships inside an installer.
src/main/resources/dashboard/** -text
src/main/resources/webui/** -text
